        <dictScrap type="liebermann"><hi rend="bold">III</hi>) <hi rend="bold">witan</hi> <hi rend="italic">beachten, in Obacht nehmen:</hi> læsse ge mare <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 3 [<hi rend="italic">nicht</hi> wĭtan: <hi rend="italic">‘kennen’, da <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:ebenda"><abbr>ebd.</abbr></ref> <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:capitulum"><abbr>c.</abbr></ref></hi> 4 <hi rend="italic">synonym</hi> gyme <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:steht"><abbr>steht</abbr></ref></hi>]; <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:flectiert"><abbr>fl</abbr></ref>.:</hi> is to ~nne, hwam <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wif">Wif</ref> 2; sciendum, <hi rend="italic">wohl <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:falsch"><abbr>falsch</abbr></ref>,</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Quadr">Q</ref> | <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Optativ"><abbr>op</abbr></ref></hi> 3: wite, þæt he gelæste (bete) <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 7 (<ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 75,2, videat <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Quadr">Q</ref>); man wite, þæt <hi rend="italic">man sehe sich vor, es werde verhütet</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wif">Wif</ref> 9; previdere <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Quadr">Q</ref> | <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:vielleicht"><abbr>viell.</abbr></ref> zu</hi> wĭtan <hi rend="italic">gehörig: <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Plural"><abbr>pl</abbr></ref></hi> 1: witen, hwæt <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAs">VI As</ref> 8,1 (<hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Plural"><abbr>pl</abbr></ref></hi> 3: witon, þæt; ~, hwæt 3) <hi rend="italic">vermerken, beachten;</hi> scire <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Quadr">Q</ref> — <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Derivativ"><abbr>Der.</abbr></ref>:</hi> gew~</dictScrap>
